All those who posted, and all those who sent mail.  In case you missed
it, Elvish abilities are: Speed, Sleep Resistance, See Invisible, and 
Searching, Stealth and Strident Alignment.  They're not much wrt combat,
at least not at the beginning, but if you start slowly enough, you should
do well.  Of course, this applies to just about every character.

